  "description": "A fully managed, cross-platform OpenGL bindings library for .NET 10. Exposes the OpenGL Core-profile API through function-pointer P/Invoke dispatch, with cross-platform native-library resolution and the vector / matrix / scalar maths types the OpenGL signatures use. The P/Invoke method bodies ship as ordinary source, so no Roslyn source generator runs in the build.",
